# Guards

ce-job-name-guard-commander = Guard Commander
ce-job-desc-guard-commander = The most dangerous person in the district. Command a squad of soldiers to ensure the safety of all command members.

ce-job-name-guard = Guard
ce-job-desc-guard = A combat unit of the empire, sworn to protect its people. Keep watch over security and defend others from potential dangers.

ce-job-name-investigator = Investigator
ce-job-desc-investigator = A specialist in catching and neutralizing particularly dangerous criminals.

# Tavern

ce-job-name-tavernmaster = Tavern Master
ce-job-desc-tavernmaster = Organize your staff's work to maximize profits... Or not.

ce-job-name-bartender = Bartender
ce-job-desc-bartender = Not implemented.

ce-job-name-chef = Chef
ce-job-desc-chef = Not implemented.

ce-job-name-farmer = Farmer
ce-job-desc-farmer = Your garden is your fortress. Grow anything you like, and experiment with irradiating plants to obtain previously nonexistent varieties of produce.

# Engineering

ce-job-name-brigadier = Brigadier
ce-job-desc-brigadier = Lead engineering units, oversee all technical operations, and ensure the preservation of state infrastructure.

ce-job-name-technician = Technician
ce-job-desc-technician = Perform technical repair and preventative maintenance work. Help the brigadier keep everything running smoothly.

# Citizens

ce-job-name-bard = Bard
ce-job-desc-bard = Music, fun, and jokes are your work and bread. Make this city's life more cheerful, and try not to die in poverty.

ce-job-name-townfolk = Townsperson
ce-job-desc-townfolk = A free citizen who has saved enough money to afford a week off and do whatever their heart desires.

ce-job-name-tailor-merchant = Tailor Merchant
ce-job-desc-tailor-merchant = A free citizen who owns a small clothing shop.

ce-job-name-pharmacist-merchant = Apothecary Merchant
ce-job-desc-pharmacist-merchant = A free citizen who owns a small pharmacy, trading in medicines and herbs.

ce-job-name-homegoods-merchant = Home Goods Merchant
ce-job-desc-homegoods-merchant = A free citizen who owns a small shop for home goods and decor.
